<title>UK: Budgens half year profits up 17.7 pct. [CORRECTED 08:15 GMT]</title>
<headline>Budgens half year profits up 17.7 pct. [CORRECTED 08:15 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>28 weeks to November 10 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		2.30		   vs 2.08</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 0.40		   vs 0.35</p>
<p> Pretax		     5.04		   vs 4.29</p>
<p> Turnover		   183.0		  vs 169.3</p>
<p>Full company name - Budgens Plc, the supermarket group, also saw like-for-like sales grow by 4.5 percent (Corrects from 8.1 percent) in the period.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
